			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 96%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Company did not hold its annual meeting of the Company&#8217;s stockholders in fiscal year 2024, and therefore, there were no grants of RSUs for the Company&#8217;s directors in fiscal year 2024. The fiscal year 2024 director RSU grants will occur in connection with the annual shareholder meeting referenced herein, to be held on June [ ], 2025.</p>
