			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 4%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">(2)</p>
			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 96%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Amounts paid to Mr. Gehl consist of his annual retainer, Audit Committee Chair fees and Strategic Committee member fees, as described above.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
