			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 96%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Amounts paid to Mr. Jung consist of his annual retainer, Compensation Committee Chair fees, Strategic Committee Chair fees and Audit Committee member fees, as described above.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
