			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 96%;">
			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">In connection with Mr. Jung&#8217;s appointment as a director on our Board, the Company and Mr. Jung entered into the Consulting Agreement (defined below), pursuant to which Mr. Jung will provide the Company with strategic advice and planning services for which Mr. Jung receives a cash payment of $7,500 per month from the Company. The Consulting Agreement had an initial term that extended to December 31, 2019, was extended through June 30, 2020, and continues on a month-to-month basis, upon mutual agreement of Mr. Jung and the Company.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 4%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 96%;">&nbsp;</td>
