			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Amounts paid to Mr. Keller consist of his annual retainer, Nominating and Governance Committee Chair fees, Compensation Committee member fees, Strategic Committee member fees and Audit Committee member fees, as described above. Mr. Keller was appointed to the Compensation Committee in April 2020.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 4%;">&nbsp;</td>
			<td style="vertical-align: top; width: 96%;">&nbsp;</td>
